# kask: pick the whole cluster or a pod, then talk to Claude with that context
Output docs/kask.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1300
Set Height 640
Set Padding 18
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 80ms
Hide
Type "export PS1='demo $ ' && clear"
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Show
Type "kask"
Enter
Sleep 3s
Down
Sleep 1500ms
Up
Sleep 1200ms
Enter
Sleep 13s
